here on earth ?

00:16:49.888 --> 00:16:51.821
MEOW.

00:16:52.090 --> 00:16:54.758
NO KITTY, THIS
IS<i> MY</i> POT PIE !

00:16:54.760 --> 00:16:55.792
MEOW.

00:16:55.794 --> 00:16:57.293
NO, BAD KITTY.

00:16:57.295 --> 00:16:59.562
NO KITTY, THIS
IS MY POT PIE !

00:16:59.564 --> 00:17:02.499
MOM, KITTY'S
BEING A DILDO !

