( beeped out )

00:20:42.220 --> 00:20:45.321
HEY WENDY,
WHAT'S A &%$#@ ?

00:20:47.959 --> 00:20:50.026
IKE, JUMP DOWN, NOW !

00:20:50.028 --> 00:20:53.363
FOR THE LOVE
OF GOD IKE, JUMP !

00:20:53.365 --> 00:20:54.697
DON'T HURT ME...

00:20:54.699 --> 00:20:56.933
( mooing )

00:21:02.974 --> 00:21:04.507
MOO.

00:21:11.349 --> 00:21:11.948
COME ON IKE,

00:21:11.950 --> 00:21:14.951
I PROMISE I'LL BE NICE
TO YOU FROM NOW ON.

00:21:14.953 --> 00:21:16.986
DON'T KICK
THE BABY.

00:21:21.926 --> 00:21:24.560
WHAT THE HELL ARE
THEY TALKING ABOUT ?

00:21:32.804 --> 00:21:34.103
IKE !

00:21:39.344 --> 00:21:40.009
IKE !

00:21:40.011 --> 00:21:43.279
DO YOUR IMPERSONATION OF
<i>DAVID CARUSO'S</i> CAREER.

00:21:43.281 --> 00:21:44.981
IT'S MY TURN.

00:21:56.695 --> 00:21:59.929
YOU GUYS GET ME
DOWN FROM HERE.

00:21:59.931 --> 00:22:01.798
HELP !

00:22:01.800 --> 00:22:03.533
HELP... !

00:22:03.535 --> 00:22:07.236
DILDO !!

00:22:08.073 --> 00:22:10.106
I'M SURE GLAD
THAT'S OVER WITH.

00:22:10.108 --> 00:22:12.809
YEAH, BOY, AM I
GLAD TO SEE YOU IKE.

00:22:12.811 --> 00:22:15.345
FLY IN THE SKY.

00:22:15.347 --> 00:22:15.945
WAIT !

00:22:15.947 --> 00:22:18.448
WHERE ARE YOU GOING
ALIEN VISITORS ?

00:22:18.450 --> 00:22:19.315
COME BACK !

00:22:19.317 --> 00:22:21.384
WELL CHEF, WHERE'S
THIS AMAZING THING

00:22:21.386 --> 00:22:22.652
YOU WERE GONNA
SHOW US ?

00:22:22.654 --> 00:22:24.921
WELL, IT'S IN
THE BEDROOM, LADIES.

00:22:24.923 --> 00:22:25.922
COME ON IN.

00:22:25.924 --> 00:22:26.489
COME ON IKE,

00:22:26.491 --> 00:22:27.990
WE CAN MAKE IT IN
TIME FOR DINNER.

00:22:27.992 --> 00:22:29.826
THANKS FOR YOUR
HELP WENDY.

00:22:29.828 --> 00:22:30.560
WHATEVER DUDE.

00:22:30.562 --> 00:22:32.528
HEY, I DIDN'T
THROW UP !

00:22:32.530 --> 00:22:33.329
COOL.

00:22:33.331 --> 00:22:35.565
( romantic music )

00:22:41.606 --> 00:22:42.605
EW !

00:22:42.607 --> 00:22:43.139
SORRY.

00:22:43.141 --> 00:22:45.074
HEY LOOK,
A FRENCH FRY.

00:22:45.076 --> 00:22:46.008
COOL.

00:22:46.010 --> 00:22:46.676
AND WHAT IS THAT ?

00:22:46.678 --> 00:22:48.177
I THINK IT'S PART
OF A CHEESY POOF.

00:22:48.179 --> 00:22:49.645
HEY, WHAT'S THAT ?

00:22:49.647 --> 00:22:50.980
THAT'S A HAMBURGER.

00:22:50.982 --> 00:22:52.548
THAT'S FROM LIKE
TWO DAYS AGO.

00:22:52.550 --> 00:22:54.083
HEY, WHAT
ABOUT THAT ?

00:22:54.085 --> 00:23:00.323
I DON'T KNOW WHAT
THE HELL THAT IS !

00:23:00.325 --> 00:23:01.724
AND CARTMAN STILL
ISN'T AROUND.

00:23:01.726 --> 00:23:03.493
YEAH, WE'RE RUNNING
OUT OF FRIENDS.

00:23:03.495 --> 00:23:05.294
I WONDER WHAT
THAT THING WAS

00:23:05.296 --> 00:23:07.764
THAT THE VISITORS
GAVE THE COWS ?

00:23:10.101 --> 00:23:12.535
COWS, I GOT
YOU CORNERED.

00:23:12.537 --> 00:23:15.238
LET'S SEE YOU
GET AWAY NOW.

00:23:16.541 --> 00:23:17.473
♪ I LOVE TO SINGA ♪

00:23:17.475 --> 00:23:20.343
♪ ABOUT THE MOONA
AND THE JUNA AND THE SPRINGA ♪

00:23:20.345 --> 00:23:21.544
♪ I LOVE TO SINGA ♪

00:23:21.546 --> 00:23:24.747
♪ ABOUT A SKY OF BLUE
OR TEA FOR TWO...♪

00:23:25.984 --> 00:23:27.316
OH, HEY CARTMAN.

00:23:27.318 --> 00:23:27.917
WOW CARTMAN.

00:23:27.919 --> 00:23:28.885
THE VISITORS
DROPPED YOU OFF

00:23:28.887 --> 00:23:30.553
JUST IN TIME
TO GO TO SCHOOL.

00:23:30.555 --> 00:23:31.287
OH MAN,

00:23:31.289 --> 00:23:33.656
I HAD THIS CRAZY
NIGHTMARE LAST NIGHT.

00:23:33.658 --> 00:23:34.624
REALLY,
WHAT ABOUT ?

00:23:34.626 --> 00:23:37.293
WELL I WAS STANDING
OUT IN A FIELD

00:23:37.295 --> 00:23:39.829
AND I HAD THIS HUGE
SATELLITE DISH

00:23:39.831 --> 00:23:41.030
STICKING OUT
OF MY BUTT.

00:23:41.032 --> 00:23:44.000
AND THEN THERE WAS
HUNDREDS OF COWS AND ALIENS

00:23:44.002 --> 00:23:45.735
AND THEN I WENT
UP ON THE SHIP

00:23:45.737 --> 00:23:47.804
AND<i> SCOTT BAIO</i>
GAVE ME PINK EYE.

00:23:47.806 --> 00:23:49.372
THAT WASN'T
A DREAM, CARTMAN.

00:23:49.374 --> 00:23:50.506
THAT REALLY HAPPENED.

00:23:50.508 --> 00:23:51.274
OH, RIGHT.

00:23:51.276 --> 00:23:52.809
WHY DON'T I HAVE
PINK EYE THEN ?

00:23:52.811 --> 00:23:55.178
CARTMAN, YOU
<i>DO</i> HAVE PINK EYE.

00:23:55.180 --> 00:23:57.613
SON-OF-A-BITCH !
